WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:04.990
Did you know that Tesla’s batteries are&nbsp;
structured in a special way to pack more energy?

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:09.370
In the same way that aircraft wings store&nbsp;
fuel instead of needing a fuel tank,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:14.410
Tesla decided to build a battery pack that&nbsp;
doesn’t contain excess structure, either.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:18.910
This also reduces the total mass of&nbsp;
the battery pack and improves range.

